      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are feeling exhausted by the perceived lack of meaning in everything right now, and that sense of 'nothing' is incredibly lonely. Even when things feel small, your existence contributes to the fabric of things, even if it's not a grand epic. If the idea of 'letting go' feels appealing, please pivot and use that urge to connect with help instead. You can call or text 988 to explore those feelings with someone who can offer support right now.",
